#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: anythingmcp-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "AnythingMCP for WooCommerce"
msgstr "AnythingMCP for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: anythingmcp-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://anythingmcp.com/marketplace/woocommerce"
msgstr "https://anythingmcp.com/marketplace/woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: anythingmcp-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Connect your store to Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot and Gemini through AnythingMCP. Creates a WooCommerce REST API key and opens the AnythingMCP setup with your store address filled in."
msgstr "Collega il tuo negozio a Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot e Gemini tramite AnythingMCP. Crea una chiave REST API di WooCommerce e apre la configurazione di AnythingMCP con l’indirizzo del negozio già compilato."

#. Author of the plugin
#: anythingmcp-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "helpcode.ai GmbH"
msgstr "helpcode.ai GmbH"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: anythingmcp-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://helpcode.ai"
msgstr "https://helpcode.ai"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-api-keys.php:26
msgid "Read/Write"
msgstr "Lettura/Scrittura"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-api-keys.php:27
msgid "Read"
msgstr "Lettura"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-api-keys.php:46
msgid "Unknown permission level."
msgstr "Livello di autorizzazione sconosciuto."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-api-keys.php:49
msgid "WooCommerce is not active."
msgstr "WooCommerce non è attivo."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-api-keys.php:72
msgid "The API key could not be saved."
msgstr "Non è stato possibile salvare la chiave API."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:20
msgid "AI Assistants"
msgstr "Assistenti IA"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:35
msgid "Self-hosted AnythingMCP"
msgstr "AnythingMCP self-hosted"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:37
msgid "AnythingMCP is open source. If you run your own instance, enter its address here. Leave it empty to use AnythingMCP Cloud."
msgstr "AnythingMCP è open source. Se gestisci una tua istanza, inserisci qui il suo indirizzo. Lascia vuoto per usare AnythingMCP Cloud."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:41
msgid "Self-hosted AnythingMCP URL"
msgstr "URL di AnythingMCP self-hosted"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:46
msgid "An https:// address, for example https://mcp.example.com."
msgstr "Un indirizzo https://, per esempio https://mcp.example.com."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:66
msgid "The self-hosted AnythingMCP URL must be an https:// address. The previous value was kept."
msgstr "L’URL di AnythingMCP self-hosted deve essere un indirizzo https://. È stato mantenuto il valore precedente."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:95
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copiato"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:96
msgid "Select the text and copy it by hand."
msgstr "Seleziona il testo e copialo a mano."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:97
msgid "The API key could not be created. Reload the page and try again."
msgstr "Non è stato possibile creare la chiave API. Ricarica la pagina e riprova."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:113
msgid "Use your store in Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot and Gemini"
msgstr "Usa il tuo negozio in Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot e Gemini"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:115
msgid "AnythingMCP connects your store to AI assistants such as Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot and Gemini. Ask about orders, products, stock and customers in plain language."
msgstr "AnythingMCP collega il tuo negozio ad assistenti IA come Claude, ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot e Gemini. Chiedi di ordini, prodotti, magazzino e clienti con parole tue."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:118
msgid "Your data stays behind your own WooCommerce API key. You can revoke it at any time."
msgstr "I tuoi dati restano dietro la tua chiave API di WooCommerce. Puoi revocarla in qualsiasi momento."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:119
msgid "Read-only by default: the assistant can look things up but not change them."
msgstr "Di base solo lettura: l’assistente può consultare i dati ma non modificarli."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:120
msgid "This plugin sends nothing by itself. Your browser opens AnythingMCP only when you click the button below."
msgstr "Questo plugin non invia nulla da solo. Il tuo browser apre AnythingMCP solo quando fai clic sul pulsante qui sotto."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:125
msgid "Store address"
msgstr "Indirizzo del negozio"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:129
msgid "AnythingMCP connects only to stores on https://. Set up HTTPS for this site first."
msgstr "AnythingMCP si collega solo a negozi su https://. Configura prima HTTPS per questo sito."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:133
msgid "The REST API needs pretty permalinks. Choose any structure other than \"Plain\" under Settings → Permalinks."
msgstr "La REST API richiede permalink leggibili. Scegli una struttura diversa da “Semplice” in Impostazioni → Permalink."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:139
msgid "WooCommerce version"
msgstr "Versione di WooCommerce"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:144
msgid "1. Create an API key"
msgstr "1. Crea una chiave API"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:146
msgid "The key belongs to your user and can do what your user can do, limited by the permission you choose."
msgstr "La chiave appartiene al tuo utente e può fare ciò che può fare il tuo utente, entro l’autorizzazione che scegli."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:151
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Autorizzazioni"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:158
msgid "Read: the assistant can look up orders, products, customers and reports. Read/Write: it can also change prices, stock and orders, and create products and coupons."
msgstr "Lettura: l’assistente può consultare ordini, prodotti, clienti e report. Lettura/Scrittura: può anche modificare prezzi, giacenze e ordini e creare prodotti e coupon."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:165
msgid "Create API key"
msgstr "Crea chiave API"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:175
msgid "API key generated successfully."
msgstr "Chiave API generata correttamente."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:176
msgid "Make sure to copy your new keys now as the secret key will be hidden once you leave this page."
msgstr "Copia subito le nuove chiavi: il secret non sarà più visibile quando lasci questa pagina."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:181
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrizione"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:185
msgid "Consumer key"
msgstr "Consumer key"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:188
#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:196
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copia"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:193
msgid "Consumer secret"
msgstr "Consumer secret"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:203
msgid "2. Open AnythingMCP"
msgstr "2. Apri AnythingMCP"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:205
msgid "Your store address is already filled in. Paste the consumer key and secret there and click \"Check and install\". AnythingMCP then shows how to add your store to Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot or Gemini."
msgstr "L’indirizzo del negozio è già compilato. Incolla lì consumer key e consumer secret e fai clic su “Check and install”. AnythingMCP ti mostra poi come aggiungere il negozio a Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot o Gemini."

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:209
msgid "Open AnythingMCP"
msgstr "Apri AnythingMCP"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:210
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(si apre in una nuova scheda)"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:214
msgid "Setup guide"
msgstr "Guida"

#: includes/class-amcp-wc-settings-page.php:216
msgid "Manage or revoke API keys (Advanced → REST API)"
msgstr "Gestisci o revoca le chiavi API (Avanzate → REST API)"

#: includes/functions.php:62
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni"

#: includes/functions.php:159
msgid "Use a POST request."
msgstr "Usa una richiesta POST."

#: includes/functions.php:165
msgid "You are not allowed to create API keys."
msgstr "Non hai i permessi per creare chiavi API."
